==English==

===Etymology===
Algonquian ''torope'' meaning "a little [[turtle]]"

===Noun===
'''terrapin'''

# any of several [[North American]] [[turtle]]s, of the [[family]] ''[[Emydiolae]]'' that live in [[fresh]] or [[brackish]] [[water]]

